                                                "example_id": "a75591e8-4915-464c-9949-37bc0b583812",
                                                "sense_id": "e8a3de5c-9330-34ee-8a50-01146400e66c",
                                                "text": "Your soul forgot her joys, forgot / Her times of teen; / Yea, this life likewise will you not / Forget"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "72bbc8d5-e4ee-4fc1-bda5-a66144956ddc",
                                                "sense_id": "e8a3de5c-9330-34ee-8a50-01146400e66c",
                                                "text": "With public toil and private teen Thou sank'st alone."
                                            },
